1
00:00:00,178 --> 00:00:02,718
(Leonard:)Your psychic didn't tell you
I was going to be a jerk?

2
00:00:03,264 --> 00:00:04,974
Heh, heh. Bite me.

3
00:00:06,643 --> 00:00:09,233
(Leonard:)-Come on, Penny.
-Why don't you kids go ahead and chat?

4
00:00:09,437 --> 00:00:12,027
(Howard:)We're gonna make out back here.

5
00:00:15,068 --> 00:00:17,318
(Bernadette:)I'm sliding into third.

6
00:00:21,574 --> 00:00:22,864
(Raj:)Thanks for coming with me.

7
00:00:23,034 --> 00:00:26,414
(Sheldon:)Thanks for giving me your limited edition
Green Lantern lantern.

8
00:00:27,038 --> 00:00:28,998
(Raj:)Did you really have to bring it
with you?

9
00:00:29,165 --> 00:00:32,965
(Sheldon:)What if evil strikes
and my power ring runs low?

10
00:00:36,589 --> 00:00:38,679
(Raj:)-Come on, let's get a drink.
-I don't drink.

11
00:00:38,842 --> 00:00:39,882
(Raj:)Well, I do.

12
00:00:40,051 --> 00:00:44,601
(Raj:)And when my wingman is carrying
a Green Lantern lantern, I drink a lot.

13
00:00:44,764 --> 00:00:48,434
(Raj:)I'll have a screwdriver, please.
And don't be chintzy with the screw.

14
00:00:49,227 --> 00:00:51,107
I would like a root-beer float.

15
00:00:52,355 --> 00:00:55,775
(Raj:)-Sheldon, they don't have ice cream.
-They don't?

16
00:00:55,984 --> 00:01:00,024
(Sheldon:)Well, apparently these people and I
differ greatly on the definition of "party."

